  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "\nThe problem - \nI get a ton of friend requests from users that I have never met in game. This sounds like it would be fine, although it has become a bit of an issue for me as there is a ton of spam friend requests I have to sort through / delete every week. I try and treat my friends list more like a \"Best friends list\" in a way. It takes me some time to get used to being around people and I generally like to keep my circles small for personal reasons. \n\n\nThe solution thus far -\nThe best I can do at this point is to use an ult account, which is not ideal as it keeps me from accessing content on my main account.\n\n\nThe best solution - \nAll I ask is for a system that allows users to set under what circumstances another user can send a friend request as I get a lot of spam and solicitation from people who I have never met in game.",
